{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ember awakens and quickly finds herself in Hell. This is a roguelite shooter that will have you spewing chunks of happiness all over your Dad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Steam_Titles_Descend_Small.png?t=1749549428\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Gif_Descend_short-optimize.gif?t=1749549428\" /></div>Descend into gory chambers of Hell inspired by classic horror franchises: it\u2019s pulsating gory, visceral, and just plain gross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Steam_Titles_Butcher!_Small__1_.png?t=1749549428\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Gif_Butcher_short-optimize.gif?t=1749549428\" /></div>Butcher the damned of Hell into piles of gore using Ember's chainsaw-gun and other violent and hilarious weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Steam_Titles_Upgrade_Small.png?t=1749549428\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Gif_Upgrade_short-optimize.gif?t=1749549428\" /></div>Upgrade bombs and weapons with cursed items and hone your own skills while you dig your way out of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Steam_Titles_Annihilate_Small.png?t=1749549428\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Gif_Annihilate_short-optimize.gif?t=1749549428\" /></div>Annihilate disgusting bosses, garb yourself in their viscera, and discover the truth about Ember's past and the future of reality while maintaining a cool, cute exterior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/extras/Steam_Titles_Features_Small.png?t=1749549428\" /></div>Bespoke gore engine<br>Randomised dungeons <br>Stacks of guns <br>Hundreds of upgrades and synergistic items <br>Hordes of enemy types <br>So many bosses <br>Twin-stick shooter action <br>Roguelite gameplay <br>Collectible stickers <br>Discounted therapy appointments <br>Maladaptive parenting practices </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3217880?t=1749549428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749549428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/5462557debd20653ff04bc6c30ec5fba4748df00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749549428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217880/5462557debd20653ff04bc6c30ec5fba4748df00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749549428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game depicts high levels of cartoon fantasy violence and gore including blood, internal organs, and corpses which are only appropriate for adults. It contains dark and mature themes, including suggestions of parental neglect, nightmares, and travel to Hell. "},"controller_support":"full","detaile